[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Yume "Oh? The room feels kind of..."[p]
Yume "It feels like someone's watching me... Huh. There's no way though, right...?"[p]
Yume "...Did I really leave this stuff here? I swear I put it on the table before I left."[p]
Yume "There's a space between the heels by the entrance too... Was someone here?"[p]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_kanasii.gif"]Yume "No, there's no way. I know I locked the door. It should be okay."[p]
Yume "Maybe I'm just on edge because I'm tired... I should sleep early today."[p]
[chara_mod name="chara_yume" cross="false" time="500" storage="chara/121/adv_yume_okoru.gif"]Yume "Okay! Time to switch gears!"[p]
[_tb_end_text]

