[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Konno "Hello, Landlord? Can we talk?"[p]
Shinya "Yes, may I help you?"[p]
Konno "Are the security systems here all right? Yume said she felt there was something off about her room..."[p]
Shinya "Eh?! You mean there was an intruder? I hadn't heard anything about that though..."[p]
Konno "Right? And the residents are all often out, so I figured it'd be difficult for any outsiders to break in."[p]
Konno "But... If you're a resident of the building, you could easily go to her room without anyone the wiser, no?"[p]
Konno "Sorry to be rude, but there is a possibility right? Anything seem suspicious?"[p]
Shinya "No, nothing I've seen."[p]
Konno "Is that so? If anything ever happens, I am going to call the cops no questions asked. I hope you understand."[p]
[_tb_end_text]

